+
+## 2. Apply-coupon service logic
+
+- [x] 2.1 Implement `OrderService.applyCoupon(orderId, couponCode)` covering existence, `ACTIVE` status, validity window, minimum amount, and FIXED/PERCENT discount computation with cap and clamp, verified by `tests/apply-coupon.test.ts` cases for each rule (valid FIXED, valid PERCENT, unknown, disabled, expired, not-yet-valid, below-minimum)
+- [x] 2.2 On success persist the discount on the order and record the redemption via the repository methods, verified by asserting the returned order and the coupon `used_count`
+
+## 3. Route and wiring
