+- [x] 3.2 Verify acceptance status codes: HTTP 200 for a valid coupon and HTTP 400 for an invalid/expired coupon, plus HTTP 404 for an unknown order
+
+## 4. Verification
+
+- [x] 4.1 Run `npm run build` and confirm the TypeScript type check passes
+- [x] 4.2 Run `npm test` and confirm both the existing suite and the new apply-coupon tests pass
